Package: loft-panel
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: loft
Depends: loft-node, adduser, systemd
Recommends: nginx
Description: web admin for a loft server
 Browser panel for one loft node: networks as a managed switch, members
 and keys, and (as they land) addresses, domains, mail and packages.
 Runs as its own user behind nginx; a small root helper on a unix socket
 rewrites the node's files and restarts it.
